@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@
 
 ## Design Direction
 
-Obsidian + Rose Gold. **Barlow Condensed** (600–900) for display/headings, **Barlow** (400–700) for body/UI. Perfect-fourth type scale (1.333×) via `--text-xs` through `--text-3xl` tokens. Accent: `--color-amber: #D4856A`. Dark: `--color-charcoal: #0C0808`. Light cream: `--color-sand: #FAF4F2`. Rectangular buttons (3px radius). Dark/light section alternation.
+Golden Hour Cinema. Bodoni Moda (400-500, sentence case, italic amber em accents) for display/headings, Figtree (300-600) for body/UI. Accent --color-amber #C9913F / --color-amber-light #E8B25C. Dark --color-charcoal #141009. Cream --color-sand #F5EFE2. Pill buttons (999px). Dark/light section alternation stays.
 
 ## Typography Rules (impeccable)
 
